    <title>High Wind Warning issued October 11 at 12:18PM PDT until October 11 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Las Vegas NV</title>
    <summary>* WHAT...South winds 35 to 45 mph with gusts of 60 to 70 mph
expected.

* WHERE...The Colorado River Valley including Lake Mead, Lake Mohave,
Lake Havasu, Needles, Laughlin, and Bullhead City. Mohave County,
southern and northeastern Clark County, the Spring Mountains, and
the Sheep Range.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT / MST this evening.

* IMPACTS...Damaging winds will blow down trees and power lines.
Widespread power outages are expected. Travel will be difficult,
especially for high profile vehicles. Expect dangerous boating
conditions for all water craft on area lakes.</summary>
