    <title>Freeze Warning issued October 11 at 11:29AM PDT until October 12 at 9:00AM PDT by NWS Pendleton OR</title>
    <summary>* WHAT...Sub-freezing temperatures as low as 28 expected.

* WHERE...Kittitas Valley.

* WHEN...From 11 PM this evening to 9 AM PDT Monday.

* IMPACTS...Frost and freeze conditions could kill crops, other
sensitive vegetation and possibly damage unprotected outdoor
plumbing.</summary>
